  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Ebbrox Ambassador Programme</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Ebbrox makes saltwater fishing gear — lures, rods, bags and apparel — built and tested on the South Devon coast. We're building a crew of anglers who fish hard, post honestly, and get rewarded for bringing others into the brand.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Tier 1 — Start earning from day one</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Sign up and you're in — no waiting, no application queue. Grab your unique link, share your fishing, and start earning:</p><ul dir=\"ltr\"><li><strong>5%</strong> commission on every referred sale, from your first sign-up</li><li>Automatically rises to <strong>8%</strong> as your referred sales grow</li><li>Automatically rises to <strong>10%</strong> once you're consistently driving sales our way</li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\">No re-applying, no asking — the system tracks your sales and moves you up the ladder itself.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Rise through the ranks:</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Keep performing and you're automatically promoted into our next tier, which unlocks a 20%-off code to share with your own community, ongoing commission on every repeat customer you bring back, and a welcome parcel of free gear on us. You're not applying for it — you earn your way in.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Got a large YouTube following in fishing or adventure?</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\">If you're running an established channel in this space, don't go through the standard sign-up — get in touch with us directly via ebbrox.com or our social channels. We run a separate content partnership for creators at that level, including a paid retainer on top of commission.</p></div>",
